{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p008a","title":"陈登遣使向袁绍告迎刘备","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p008a-account","label":"《献帝春秋》","text":"陈登等遣使告袁绍奉刘备为宗主，袁绍答书表示赞同。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p008a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0022","role":"遣使","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p008a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"答书","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p008a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"徐州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p008a-q"]},"time":{"year":194,"label":"陶谦卒后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y194","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o009","basis":"陶谦卒后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-p008a-q","xianzhu-q-o009","wudi-q-o028","wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe"]},"source_order":[32,57,"P008a"],"order":6513}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0022","name":"陈登","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o028","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fefe0240b8480efce927","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年春，太祖自徐州还〖1〗。初，太祖父嵩，去官后还谯。董卓之乱，避难琅邪〖2〗。为陶谦所害，故太祖志在复仇东伐。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p008a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ce3b8af0585af6fca98c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《献帝春秋》曰：“陈登等遣使诣袁绍曰：‘天降灾沴，祸臻鄙州；州将殂殒，生民无主。恐惧奸雄一旦承隙，以贻盟主日昃之忧；辄共奉故平原相刘备府君，以为宗主，永使百姓知有依归。方今寇难纵横，不遑释甲。谨遣下吏，奔告于执事。’绍答曰：‘刘玄德，弘雅有信义；今徐州乐戴之，诚副所望也。’”","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-792ec19e17cf27515d2d","start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o009","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-939a0c2b5149377c476b","layer":"original","quote":"谦表先主为豫州刺史，屯小沛〖2〗。谦病笃，谓别驾麋竺曰〖3〗：“非刘备，不能安此州也！”谦死，竺率州人迎先主。先主未敢当，下邳陈登谓先主曰：“今汉室陵迟，海内倾覆；立功立事，在于今日！（彼）〔鄙〕州殷富〖4〗，户口百万；欲屈使君，抚临州事。”先主曰：“袁公路近在寿春〖5〗；此君四世五公〖6〗，海内所归；君可以州与之。”登曰：“公路骄豪，非治乱之主！今欲为使君合步骑十万：上可以匡主济民，成五霸之业〖7〗；下可以割地守境，书功于竹帛。若使君不见听许，登亦未敢听使君也！”北海相孔融谓先主曰：“袁公路岂忧国忘家者邪？冢中枯骨〖8〗，何足介意！今日之事，百姓与能〖9〗；天与不取，悔不可追！”先主遂领徐州。﹝一﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":304,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
